# `src/legacy` is gone

**This rule is always on.** **`src/legacy/`** was leftover and has been **removed**. Agents must **not** recreate it, relocate leftover ABI into product trees, or reintroduce `Smt_*` leftover sources under `src/`.

## Default

- Implement in product APIs (`src/gis`, `src/plugin`, `src/scenic`, `src/base`, …).
- Remaining leftover ABI, if any, lives in **`branches/`** only.

## Don’t

- **Don’t** create `src/legacy/` or leftover extract dirs (`src/base/smt`, `src/base/sys`, `gis/datasource/mgr`, leftover `*.am` AuxModule).
- **Don’t** `#include "legacy/…"` from product TUs.

## Relation

**`.cursor/rules/repo/legacy-unidirectional.mdc`** (product↛leftover). **`branches/`** is the leftover ABI remainder.
